| `name` | string | the copier answer `project_slug`: `my_project` by default, `project_keel` in keel | a slug: copier validates `project_name`, lowercases it and turns each space and hyphen into `_` | `src/backend/shared/__init__.py` `project_identity`, which falls back to the checkout directory's name when the key is absent; check_Z, which reads it as the `<name>:` prefix of a work id from another project | Renames the project's identity and the prefix other projects put before its campaign and slice ids. | the Python distribution name: `pyproject.toml` `[project] name` | always |
